    "created_at": "2019-03-20T01:25:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-20T01:25:08Z",
    "body": "Yes, sometimes it does return a ShadowRoot. Sometimes it returns a Document, or HTMLDocument, or SVGDocument, or similar. All of these are different types of Node. That is why the return value is Node.",
